# Secure Web Application

A security-focused web application built with Python, Flask, and SQLite.

This project demonstrates secure authentication and common web application security controls.

## Features

- User registration
- User login
- Protected dashboard
- Logout functionality
- Flash messages
- Responsive interface

## Security Features

- Password hashing with Werkzeug
- SQL injection prevention using parameterized queries
- CSRF protection
- Secure session cookies
- HTTP security headers
- Login rate limiting
- Server-side input validation
- Custom error pages

## Technologies

- Python
- Flask
- SQLite
- HTML
- CSS
- Flask-WTF
- Flask-Limiter
- Git
- GitHub

